Package: missionplanner-avalonia
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Sema Aviation <opensource@sema-aviation.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libicu74 | libicu72 | libicu71 | libicu70, libssl3t64 | libssl3, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libgl1, libdbus-1-3, libxkbcommon0, libice6, libsm6, libvlc5, vlc-plugin-base
Recommends: speech-dispatcher-espeak-ng, bluez
Homepage: https://github.com/sema-aviation/MissionPlanner-Avalonia
Description: cross-platform Mission Planner ground control station port
 Self-contained Avalonia port of ArduPilot Mission Planner for flight planning,
 telemetry, parameter management, log analysis, simulation and vehicle setup.
 This is an independent community project and is not affiliated with ArduPilot.
